# API Contract

## GET /api/files/videos
Returns video list.

## GET /api/files/music
Returns music list.

## GET /api/files/images
Returns image list.

## GET /api/files/documents
Returns document list.

## GET /api/files/recent
Returns last 20 recently added files.

## GET /api/stream/{id}
Streams file via HTTP Range Request support.

## GET /api/thumbnails/{id}
Returns thumbnail image.

## GET /api/files/{file_type}/{term}
Returns list of certain file type that contains that term in name

